                                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                    jcr:title="Understanding and accompanying patients "
                                    sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/title/v2/title"
                                    type="h3"
                                    variant="h"/>
                                <text
                                    cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                                    jcr:created="{Date}2024-03-10T16:11:43.815-04:00"
                                    jcr:createdBy="jewitca"
                                    jcr:lastModified="{Date}2024-05-10T13:28:08.819-04:00"
                                    jcr:lastModifiedBy="jewitca"
                                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                    sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                    text="&lt;p>Illnesses pose many challenges for patients. What does the diagnosis mean for them? What hurdles are they facing? What are their needs? At AbbVie, we are addressing these questions together with those affected and experts from the healthcare sector. Because together we can achieve a lot.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;b>Information for patients and their families&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>Anyone suffering from a serious illness wants information and support. AbbVie Switzerland offers this for both patients and their families. We want to help people understand and deal with chronic illnesses. To this end, we develop suitable patient support programmes and collaborate with patient organisations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                    textIsRich="true"/>
                                <separator
                                    cq:styleIds="[1662756456518]"
                                    jcr:created="{Date}2024-03-10T16:13:33.220-04:00"
                                    jcr:createdBy="jewitca"
                                    jcr:lastModified="{Date}2024-03-10T16:13:33.220-04:00"
                                    jcr:lastModifiedBy="jewitca"
                                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                    sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/separator/v2/separator"/>
                                <title_copy
                                    cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                                    jcr:created="{Date}2024-03-10T16:11:39.304-04:00"
                                    jcr:createdBy="jewitca"
                                    jcr:lastModified="{Date}2024-05-10T13:28:34.297-04:00"
                                    jcr:lastModifiedBy="jewitca"
                                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                    jcr:title="Collaborating with the experts caring for those affected "
                                    sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/title/v2/title"
                                    type="h3"
                                    variant="h"/>
                                <text_1103070850
                                    cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                                    jcr:created="{Date}2024-03-10T16:14:16.658-04:00"
                                    jcr:createdBy="jewitca"
                                    jcr:lastModified="{Date}2024-07-27T07:54:09.298-04:00"
                                    jcr:lastModifiedBy="jewitca"
                                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                    sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                    text="&lt;p>Patient organisations are particularly important for people with chronic illnesses. This is where patients receive concrete support, the opportunity to exchange experiences directly and find help to help themselves.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>AbbVie's collaborations include the following patient organisations.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.acneinversaschweiz.ch/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>www.acneinversaschweiz.ch&lt;/a>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aha.ch/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>www.aha.ch&lt;/a>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.arthritis.ch/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>www.arthritis.ch&lt;/a>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.bechterew.ch/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>www.bechterew.ch&lt;/a>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.crohn-colitis.ch/&quot; title=&quot;http://www.crohn-colitis.ch&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>www.crohn-colitis.ch&lt;/a>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.hopos.ch/&quot; title=&quot;http://www.hopos.ch&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>www.hopos.ch&lt;/a>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.inkontinex.ch/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>www.inkontinex.ch&lt;/a>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.lymphome.ch/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>www.lymphome.ch&lt;/a>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.migraineaction.ch/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>www.migraineaction.ch&lt;/a>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.movember.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>www.movember.com&lt;/a>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.rheumaliga.ch/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>www.rheumaliga.ch&lt;/a>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.spvg.ch/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>www.spvg.ch&lt;/a>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.parkinson.ch/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>www.parkinson.ch&lt;/a>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                    textIsRich="true"/>
